# Movies Directory

Place your movie files here. The following formats are supported:

- MP4 (H.264 + AAC) - Direct streaming, no transcoding needed
- MKV (any codec) - Smart transcoding with audio optimization  
- AVI, MOV, WMV - Full transcoding for compatibility
- HEVC/H.265 - Automatic transcoding for web browsers

Example structure:
```
movies/
├── Action/
│   ├── Movie1.mp4
│   └── Movie2.mkv
├── Comedy/
│   └── Funny_Movie.avi
└── Drama/
    └── Serious_Film.mov
```

Note: Movie files are ignored by git (.gitignore) to prevent large binary files from being committed to the repository.
